{"m":"WFG505M0MW","n":"5.1 Cu. Ft. Freestanding Gas Range with Edge to Edge Cooktop","c":"White","desc":"Cook your family's favorite foods on a freestanding gas range that has two high btu gas burners to sear and boil quickly, and an edge to edge cooktop with cast-iron grates that are dishwasher-safe. Get the flexibility to cook a wide variety of meals with help from Frozen Bake™ Technology, the built-in Broiler Drawer and more cooking modes.","img":["https://assets.skulytics.io/assets/images/WFG505M0MW-105527504.webp","https://assets.skulytics.io/assets/images/WFG505M0MW-105527505.webp","https://assets.skulytics.io/assets/images/WFG505M0MW-105527506.webp","https://assets.skulytics.io/assets/images/WFG505M0MW-105527507.webp","https://assets.skulytics.io/assets/images/WFG505M0MW-105527508.webp","https://assets.skulytics.io/assets/images/WFG505M0MW-105527509.webp"],"hl":[["Keep Warm setting","Keep dishes from getting cold with a setting that delivers low heat to the oven, so your meal is ready when you are."],["Two SpeedHeat™ Burners","Get dinner to the table fast with two SpeedHeat™ Burners that generate the high heat needed to sear and boil quickly"],["Frozen Bake™ Technology","Skip preheating and cook frozen favorites like pizza and lasagna in fewer steps with preprogrammed settings."],["Optional Griddle","Make pancakes, grill vegetables or sear steaks with the Optional Griddle that lets you optimize your cooktop space for breakfast, lunch and dinner."],["Center Oval Burner","Easily fit griddles and long cookware on this fifth burner, designed to effectively heat large surfaces."],["Dishwasher-Safe Cast-Iron Grates","Wash these cast-iron grates right in the dishwasher when they get messy, thanks to a dishwasher-safe finish that makes them easy to clean."]],"size":[["Width","29.88 in."],["Height","46.25 in."],["Depth","27.2 in."],["Weight","161 lbs."]],"docs":[["Installation instructions","https://assets.skulytics.io/assets/docs/WFG505M0MW-105527502.pdf","3.68 MB"],